  "notes": "Worker scope format fix implemented. Added two exported utility functions to sprint-spawner.ts: (1) normalizeScopePath() — trims whitespace, rejects bare extension-only paths like .json/.ts via EXTENSION_ONLY_RE regex, removes trailing slash from file paths (not directories), rejects ADR-013 protected paths CLAUDE.md/DECKENT.md including with trailing slash; (2) buildAllowedWriteTargets() — always prepends .tasks/, applies normalizeScopePath to all scope entries, deduplicates. Both spawnWorkers() and respawnEligibleTasks() now use buildAllowedWriteTargets() instead of raw inline .filter(Boolean). 43 tests in sprint-spawner.test.ts, all pass. Pre-existing tsc error in sprint-finalizer.ts:36 (readFileSafe unused) was present before this task.",
